window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-c3e282a006d960b1"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"model-strategic-scenarios-and-tradeoffs\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">建立战略情景与取舍模型</h1> <p>比较不同战略路径的假设、风险、成本、时间和影响。</p> <p>向 ChatGPT 提供财务模型、KPI 仪表板、规划文档、市场背景、利益相关方笔记、运营数据和决策标准，然后请它比较不同选项并制作一份便于审阅的取舍模型。</p> <p><a id=\"best-for\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">适合哪些情况</h2> <ul> <li>领导层需要比较不同路径并明确取舍的战略选择。</li> <li>需要综合成本、时间、运营能力和客户影响的规划决策。</li> <li>希望获得建议，同时让假设可检查、可修改的团队。</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"skills-plugins\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">技能与插件</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>技能或插件</th> <th>用途</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>$spreadsheets</code></td> <td>构建可比较的情景、敏感性分析，以及成本或时间视图。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/google-drive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">google-drive（需联网）</a></td> <td>读取模型、规划文档、仪表板和已批准的源材料。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>$documents</code></td> <td>整理选项、优先级、风险、负责人和假设，供审阅。</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p><a id=\"starter-prompt\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_4\">起步提示词</h2> <p>比较战略情景</p> <p>建议模型：<code>gpt-6-astra</code> · 建议推理级别：<code>medium</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">请比较针对 [decision] 的战略路径。\n\n使用我提供的财务模型、KPI 仪表板、规划文档、市场背景、利益相关方笔记、运营数据和决策标准。请创建情景和取舍模型，包含：\n\n- 选项和优先级矩阵\n- 建议及理由\n- 成本和时间安排\n- 风险和缓解措施\n- 负责人\n- 客户或业务影响\n- 需要检查的假设\n\n不要覆盖源模型，也不要把缺乏依据的假设当作事实。请标出需要审批的输入。\n</code></pre> <p><a id=\"related-links\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_5\">关联文档</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://openai.com/academy/codex-for-work/how-business-operations-teams-use-codex/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenAI Academy：业务运营团队（需联网）</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/codex/use-cases/refresh-forecast-and-plan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">更新预测并制定计划（需联网）</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>完整文档索引请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面 URL 末尾添加 <code>.md</code>，即可获取该页面的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"make-the-options-comparable\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_6\">让各个选项具备可比性</h2> <p>如果每个选项都使用相同的假设和决策标准，情景分析就更容易审阅。请在 ChatGPT 建立对比前，提供模型、KPI 背景、规划文档、运营数据和利益相关方约束。</p> <ol> <li>说明要作出的决策、可选方案、时间范围和判断标准。</li> <li>附上模型、仪表板、规划文档、市场背景和运营数据。</li> <li>请 ChatGPT 找出各选项共用的假设、各自特有的假设，以及缺失的假设。</li> <li>运行起始提示词，并审查成本、时间、风险、负责人和客户影响。</li> <li>明确更改假设，并比较不同情景下建议是否发生变化。</li> </ol> <p>请保留源模型，并将情景输出另存为独立文件。除了给出建议，更有价值的是清楚说明哪些假设变化会让建议发生改变。</p> <p><a id=\"test-sensitivity\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_7\">测试敏感性</h2> <p>请 ChatGPT 改变影响最大的假设，并说明在什么条件下首选方案会改变。</p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Run a sensitivity review on the scenario model.\n\nIdentify:\n\n- the assumptions with the largest effect on the recommendation\n- the breakpoints where another option becomes preferable\n- costs, timing, or customer impacts that are not comparable\n- risks that are hard to quantify\n- inputs that require owner approval\n\nDo not overwrite the model or treat a scenario as an approved plan.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">请对情景模型进行敏感性分析。\n\n找出：\n\n- 对建议影响最大的假设\n- 其他方案开始变得更可取的临界点\n- 无法直接比较的成本、时间或客户影响\n- 难以量化的风险\n- 需要负责人批准的输入\n\n不要覆盖模型，也不要将某个情景视为已经批准的计划。</div></div>","en":"<h1 id=\"model-strategic-scenarios-and-tradeoffs\">Model strategic scenarios and tradeoffs</h1> <p>Compare strategic paths with assumptions, risks, cost, timing, and impact.</p> <p>Give ChatGPT a financial model, KPI dashboard, planning docs, market context, stakeholder notes, operational data, and decision criteria, then ask it to compare options and produce a reviewable tradeoff model.</p> <h2 id=\"best-for\">Best for</h2> <ul> <li>Strategic choices where leaders need comparable paths and explicit tradeoffs.</li> <li>Planning decisions that combine cost, timing, operational capacity, and customer impact.</li> <li>Teams that want a recommendation while keeping assumptions inspectable and changeable.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"skills-plugins\">Skills &amp; Plugins</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Skill or plugin</th> <th>Why use it</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>$spreadsheets</code></td> <td>Build comparable scenarios, sensitivities, and cost or timing views.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/google-drive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">google-drive (online)</a></td> <td>Read models, planning docs, dashboards, and approved source material.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>$documents</code></td> <td>Summarize options, prioritization, risks, ownership, and assumptions for review.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <h2 id=\"starter-prompt\">Starter prompt</h2> <p>Compare strategic scenarios</p> <p>Suggested model：<code>gpt-6-astra</code> · Suggested reasoning effort：<code>medium</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Compare strategic paths for [decision].\n\nUse the financial model, KPI dashboard, planning docs, market context, stakeholder notes, operational data, and decision criteria I provide. Create a scenario and tradeoff model with:\n\n- options and prioritization matrix\n- recommendation and rationale\n- cost and timing\n- risks and mitigations\n- ownership\n- customer or business impact\n- assumptions to inspect\n\nDo not overwrite the source model or treat unsupported assumptions as facts. Flag inputs that need approval.\n</code></pre> <h2 id=\"related-links\">Related links</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://openai.com/academy/codex-for-work/how-business-operations-teams-use-codex/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenAI Academy: Business operations teams (online)</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/codex/use-cases/refresh-forecast-and-plan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Refresh a forecast and plan (online)</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"make-the-options-comparable\">Make the options comparable</h2> <p>Scenario work is easier to review when every option uses the same assumptions and decision criteria. Give ChatGPT the model, KPI context, planning documents, operational data, and stakeholder constraints before it builds the comparison.</p> <ol> <li>State the decision, options, time horizon, and criteria.</li> <li>Attach models, dashboards, planning docs, market context, and operational data.</li> <li>Ask ChatGPT to identify assumptions that are shared, option-specific, or missing.</li> <li>Run the starter prompt and review cost, timing, risk, ownership, and customer impact.</li> <li>Change assumptions explicitly and compare the recommendation across scenarios.</li> </ol> <p>Keep the source model intact and save scenario outputs separately. The most useful result is not only a recommendation but also a clear explanation of which assumptions would change it.</p> <h2 id=\"test-sensitivity\">Test sensitivity</h2> <p>Ask ChatGPT to vary the assumptions that matter most and show when the preferred option changes.</p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Run a sensitivity review on the scenario model.\n\nIdentify:\n\n- the assumptions with the largest effect on the recommendation\n- the breakpoints where another option becomes preferable\n- costs, timing, or customer impacts that are not comparable\n- risks that are hard to quantify\n- inputs that require owner approval\n\nDo not overwrite the model or treat a scenario as an approved plan.\n</code></pre>"};
